```

 in the specified path is not a directory but the first part of the image name.

```
How to use custom PHP code?PHP code can be added to your (child) theme's functions.php file. Alternatively, you can use the Custom Hooks add-on, or a code snippets plugin. More infoadd_filter( 'facetwp_map_init_args', function( $args ) {
