When you are using the [Woocommerce Product Recommendations](https://woocommerce.com/products/product-recommendations/), FacetWP’s query detection will cause problems with the query for the recommended products on your cart page.

Add the following code to your (child) theme’s functions.php to fix this issue:

```
How to use custom PHP code?PHP code can be added to your (child) theme's functions.php file. Alternatively, you can use the Custom Hooks add-on, or a code snippets plugin. More infoadd_filter( 'facetwp_is_main_query', function( $is_main_query, $query ) {
  if ( function_exists( 'is_cart' ) && is_cart() ) {
    $is_main_query = false;
  }
  return $is_main_query;
}, 8, 2 );
```


